<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">Kharam: Bible Translation 1st Edition.</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Jude</para>
  <para style="toc1">JUDE Chemajia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jude</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jud</para>
  <para style="mt1">JUDE</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chemajia</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chonglamsaat</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Jude larik hi </char> Jude imajia eii. Jude apum tak-in James naipa ka-eii tiya arillar. James hi Jisu naipa ejarra Jude hi-um Jisu naipa eii tiya inlei (1:1). Hiwa larik hi koisuok inkhatdiang imajia be tihi inthiarmak takkha Inzootna Maruo (Old Testament) chong katamtak inchel jarra hiwa larik hi Jihudi ngaidiang imajia ete tia inlei. Kha e-innum Jude larik hi “Pa Pathian in iminriang khat-um Jisu Christa in sansik-ah ikoi” ngaisik-ah imajia eii (Jud 1). Hiwa larik hi Jisu inneisuo kum soomruk pheiweiya imajia eii.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jude in hiwa larik amajiana jarchu akadikmak ocha ngai'n christian ngaihi lamleiitiang inroimak nasik-ah imajia eii (1:4). Jude in Inzootna Maruo (Old Testament) chong ngaihi aheichoiya halli itizoot chong ngaihi kheella mincheetna anei. Jude larik hi 2 Peter larik khale in-ang atam, akadikmak ocha ngai chungnga chongthak (1:4; 2 Pet. 2:1), hile inruoiya marwaan tirton ngai khat-um Sodom li Gomorrah jarra um injia.</para>
  <para style="iot">Asuungnga kaom Chong</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Jude in mansakhet-ah tu ngaidiang imajiame tikha amalar <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JUD 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Jude in akadikmak ocha ngai chungnga chongthakna anei <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JUD 1:3-4">1:3-4</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Jude in Inzootna Maruo (Old Testament) mi ngai khat-um kaleisuok chuon ngaikha aheichoiya minkhina anei <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JUD 1:5-16">1:5-16</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Jude chongthak ngaihi angtho tholi nijui sikme jarra majiana anei <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JUD 1:17-23">1:17-23</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">5. Jude in Pathian minpaak ah minhekna anei <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JUD 1:24-25">1:24-25</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Jude, Jisu Christa suok, khat-um James naipa ama'n,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:1">Pathian in ikoijei inmani ngaidiang, Pa Pathian minriangna nuoiya karing khat-um Jisu Christa sanna nuoiya kaom inmani ngaidiang: <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 13:55">Matt 13:55</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:3">Mk 6:3</ref></char><verse eid="JUD 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Inriang, kadai, khat-um minriang hi nangnita erase.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akadikmak Ocha ngai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Minriang kaom kasap ngai, eini rakip in nimusuom sanminringna jarra kei'n nangni diang majia nasik-ah kamalung aluutthei, Pathian in ami ngaidiang apha rakip sik-ah ipejei ngamna kha mathaan maru tihi kei'n nangnidiang majiamak khat-um namasokmak kathamak kha ejei. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Ajarchu Pathian kajetmak miring lekkhat in jetlei theileiya eini karra inheiluutjei, inmani'n eini Pathian riangwai chongpui kha aleiitiang inchoiya akadikmak chuontho nasik-ah lam inminchang jei, halli inkhatbit ka-eii eini Karu khat-um Pumi Jisu Christa kha inmani'n zootmu. Inmani'n mangna inmunasik eii tikha Pathianchong khan apha matiang aleirilsuokjei.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Hiwa rakip hi nangni'n ningjetjei innum, kei'n woikhat nangnidiang minjet tharritna kinei kha eii, khachu Pumi'n<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pumi; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manuscript lekkhat achu hitia injia </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Jisu, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Greek chongnga injia khale in-ang </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Joshua.</char></note> Israel mi ngaikha apha inkhat-ah Egypt ramsuung makheiya aheikatan, takkha ngamna kaneimak mi ngaikha aheikatansuo nuk-ah aminmang. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 12:51">Suok 12:51</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:29-30">Teelna 14:29-30</ref></char><verse eid="JUD 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Marwaan tirton ngai'n inmani diang ipeii ranak ngaikha inrakaanna halli inmani omna mun kamathaan ngaikha Pathian in khawa chongtan kalok Nikhuoni sikbit-ah kumsoot sik-ah thirruiya khuop-ah halli aziingna munna khumma ida ejei tikha ngaidonru. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Sodom li Gomorrah, khat-um asir apangnga kaom khuopui ngaikha ngaidonru, inmani ngaikha taksa lamma zool-inthai chuon ngaikha inleitho: halli inmani ngaikha kumsoot meikhurra rachaak nakha inmu khawa kha miring rakip diang chongthak eya kasuok kha eii.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Hiwale in-angnga, hiwa mi ngai'n akadikmak mangtalar inmu dungjuiya manu intho-ah inpum ngaikha inminchok; inmani'n Pathian wairoon kha zootmu, halli chungtiangnga kalurra kaom inmani ngaikha kase-ah inril. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Marwaan tirton ngai karra kalokkhet Michael li Seitan in Moses kaluongkha inlei-inchu phakhan Seitan diang hiwa ka-ang rilsena chongkha rilmak, takkha hin thoa aleiti, “Pumi'n nangkha nazootmak!” <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Takkha hiwa mi ngai'n injetmak angrakip ngaikha kase-ah inril; halli ramsa ngai'n a-ngaiya in-ijet angnga in-ijet khan inmani ngaikha aminmangsik eii.<verse eid="JUD 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Inmani sik-ah poongna esik eii! Inmani'n Cain omchankha inleijei. Inmani nemna sik-ah akadikmak Balaam ileitho kha injuijei, inmani'n Korah itho angnga inthojei halli Korah kha inminmang angnga inmani ngaikha minmangjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 4:3-8">Inphut 4:3-8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 22:1-35">Teelna 22:1-35</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 16:1-35">Teelna 16:1-35</ref></char><verse eid="JUD 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Nangni ning-inchun suomma bubak nakhan inmani ngaikha injak omlekleiya injuobak-ah bubakna kha akachok inminchang. Inmani sikbit in-ngaidon. Inmani ngaikha thiraang khan wuongpuinarei iwuongpui halli ruochu karuoimak ziingkhum ka-ang kha in-eii. Akara pha-ah kakaramak, arajung inphukjei, acharra akathijei thingkuung ka-ang kha in-eii <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Inmani jakna kaom chuon ngaikha tuipui phuksaan tuiphuon ka-ang in-eii. Inthonnarei inthon arsi ngai ka-ang kha in-eii. khawa jarra Pathian in inmani sik-ah hektik kaboi inthuukkhet aziingna munkha ahooiya dapijei.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Adam makheiya miruol sari huuina Enoch<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Sari huuina: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiwa teelna hi inphutna makheiya insuona Adam makheiya Enoch katung raming sari teelna kha eii.</char></note> in apha matiang inmani jarra aleirilsuok: “Pumi'n ama inthiang marwaan tirton lising lising ngaile juota <char style="rq"><ref loc="NUM 5:18">Teelna 5:18</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 5:21-24">21-24</ref></char><verse eid="JUD 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />mi rakip chungnga chong tansik, halli inmani ngaikha jakna kaom inchuontho khat-um Pathian chungnga karilse manu karoon inmani ngaikha aminmangsik eii!”<verse eid="JUD 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Hiwa mi ngai'n apha rakip-ah num intia inkhatli inkhat noonkuung inpeii; Inmani taksa manuom kathamak kha injuijei; inmani inpum takkha inminpaak halli inmani nemna sik-ah mileiilaak ngaikha akadikmak lamma inminpaak.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Chongthak li Minchu mindikna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Takkha kasap ngai, apha matiangnga eini Pumi Jisu Christa tirton ngai'n nangni diang inleiril ngaikha ngaidonru.<verse eid="JUD 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />Inmani'n nangni diang inleiti, “Ahekna nikhuo ngai aheiwani, nangni kana-innuipuisik, inmani taksa imanuom kajui mipui katamtak inhongsuoksik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="2PE 3:3">2 Pet 3:3</ref></char><verse eid="JUD 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Inmani ngaihi in-eii inkhoithenna kamasuok, Ratha kha inmani diang ommak halli inmani taksa manuom nakhan inmani ngaikha akeiruoi. <verse eid="JUD 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Takkha kasap ngai nangni chu, inthiang ngamna khan kacheet-ah ngir inlang insoonru. Ratha Inthiang ranak ah Pathian diang niru, <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />Pumi Jisu Christa in ama minriang na jarra hektik kaboi ringna inapeii kha ningngaak le inruoiya Pathian minriang nakhan nangni omchakru.<verse eid="JUD 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />In-ngamsam mi ngaidiang minriang chuonkha thoru; <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />meikhur makheiya mi ngaikha kasut inlang sanru, kachile inruoiya mi leiilaak ngaidiang minriang chuonkha thoru, takkha taksa imanuom manu innootjei inret inruo ngai khachu matirru.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pathian Minpaakna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Naminpur lekleiya kanamin-ngir mator halli kachok omlekleiya khat-um karok le inruoiya ama lurna maikuungnga kanaheiruoi mator— <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />inkhatbit ka-eii Pathian eini Nakatanpa, Jisu Christa eini Pumi diangnga inphut, lurna, lianna, raatna khat-um wairoon kha akatheng khang rakip, tuun, halli kumsoot sik-ah erase! Amen.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>